"ordered",false,[78,79],"dimensions","2D","3D","Development stages",[83,84,85],"stages","Planning","Gameplay & code","Testing","Topics",[89,90,91],"tags","Multi-agent","Task planning","Research prototype","Further reading",[94],{"_52":95,"_25":96},"Paper and README repository","https://github.com/leyiwo/GameGPT","Project source",[99],{"_52":97,"_25":100},"https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.08067","Why it belongs here","Planning, review, and implementation agents break down game requirements and generate code, with a focus on hallucination and redundancy. This is an early research framework for game development agents. The linked repository contains only the paper and README; it is not a verified, ready-to-deploy product.","detail","guidance","Resource type","Paper","Category","2D development","category","lead","summary","name","2d","paper",[124],[89,90,91],[121,122,123],[113,120],2023,"3d","plan","code","test",{"_52":95,"_25":96},{"_126":127},"documents",{"_128":129,"_130":131},"en",[133,137,138,139,136,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,135,172,134,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193],"zh",[132,133,134,135,136],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-s